====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|collective}} [[bar|Bars]]; an [[arrangement]] or [[pattern]] of [[stripe]]s or bars.
# The act of fitting or closing something with bars.
# The [[exclusion]] of someone; [[blackballing]].
# {{lb|en|mining}} [[timber|Timber]] used for supporting the roof or sides of [[shaft]]s.
# {{lb|en|sewing}} The [[sewing]] of a decorative bar or [[tack]] upon a fabric or leather.
#: {{syn|en|tacking}}

